2026-07-27T08:18:02.2038653Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:18:02.2100594Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:18:02.2101350Z i /tmp/RtmpEIOrrh/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:18:02.2101876Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:18:02.2102494Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:18:02.2103335Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:18:02.2104218Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:18:02.2105736Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:18:02.2106683Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:18:02.2340215Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:18:02.2449663Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:18:02.2864483Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:18:02.3013237Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
